Configure validate-on-commit hooks (pre-commit config + Git hook).

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide setup hooks␛[0m [OPTIONS]

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
  ␛[1m-C␛[0m, ␛[1m--path␛[0m <PATH_FLAG>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

      ␛[1m--install, --no-install␛[0m
          Install .git/hooks/pre-commit when this path is a Git repository
          
          [default: install]

      ␛[1m--plan␛[0m
          List the files each step would write, and write nothing

  ␛[1m-y␛[0m, ␛[1m--yes␛[0m
          Write without asking for confirmation

      ␛[1m--help␛[0m
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide setup hooks --yes

